@startuml SplitSmartSwingMvpDeployment
left to right direction
node "User device" {
  artifact "Java 21 Swing client\n(MVP only)" as Swing
}
node "Shared application environment\n(topology TBD)" {
  artifact "Application / domain services" as App
}
database "Durable shared records\n(product TBD)" as DB
cloud "Identity / email service\n(if selected)" as Identity
cloud "In-app / external notification\n(delivery choice TBD)" as Notify
Swing --> App : application interface\n(transport/topology TBD)
App --> DB : transactional records
App --> Identity
App --> Notify
note bottom of Swing
  Swing desktop deployment is not a web experience
  and does not satisfy NFR-001.
end note
note bottom of App
  A local-only store does not by itself provide
  shared cross-user group behavior.
end note
@enduml
